LR 16.1 Exemptions from Pretrial Scheduling and Management.
The following categories of cases are exempt from the scheduling and planning 
requirements of Fed. R. Civ. P. 16(b):
(a) actions for social security benefits, including appeals from decisions of the
Secretary of Health and Human Services, and black lung cases subject to LR 9.1;
(b) prisoner civil rights complaints filed pursuant to 42 U.S.C. § 1981 et seq.;
(c) forfeiture actions;

